#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:3
#: d931f0d642e44d048deaa4daa0930c03
msgid "全局空位（Global Vacancy）"
msgstr "Global Vacancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:5
#: 7f41cffe80154286941a1dfb2ee0afa7
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:7
#: 681bd22f2dec4f48ba790dfad14a1938
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:9
#: b9aebbc32e7a41849243171f24ef514f
msgid "从输入结构的全部原子位点中随机删除原子，按整体数量或比例生成不同的空位构型。所有元素具有同等的位点采样资格；输出保留剩余原子的坐标、晶胞、PBC、逐原子数组和结构信息。"
msgstr ""
"Randomly remove atoms from all sites in the input structure to generate "
"different vacancy configurations using an overall count or fraction. "
"Sites of every element are equally eligible for sampling. The output "
"preserves the coordinates, cell, PBC, per-atom arrays, and structure "
"metadata of the remaining atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:11
#: e2c1e246f42c4f95af4e4dec48012b80
msgid "**全局空位：** 从所有位点共同采样。"
msgstr "**Global Vacancy:** sample from all sites together."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:12
#: 11556e6ea067410389306c7059e86846
msgid "**定向空位：** 按元素和可选 `group` 限定候选位点。"
msgstr ""
"**Targeted Vacancy:** restrict candidate sites by element and an optional"
" `group`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:13
#: 0d57f87a4aa64434ba53b7ca77962b03
msgid "**随机占位：** 改变位点元素，不减少原子数。"
msgstr ""
"**Random Occupancy:** change the element at a site without reducing the "
"atom count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:15
#: e425b4caaecf460194ff69dde2a6a081
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:17
#: c76ae42976f040a086bfd2b627431900
#, python-brace-format
msgid "设输入结构有 $N$ 个原子。按数量设置时，解析值就是 $n_{\\max}$；按比例 $f$ 设置时，程序向下取整："
msgstr ""
"Let the input contain $N$ atoms. When using a count, the resolved value "
"is $n_{\\max}$. When using a fraction $f$, the program rounds down:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:19
#: 96d2ed47a77142a3a2817e834079fee6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_{\\max}=\\lfloor fN\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:23
#: b7e431511d3f4b05a85b0f2c5a8c00a4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"“固定”模式的每个输出都删除 $n_{\\max}$ 个原子；“变化”模式则为每个输出从整数闭区间 $[1,n_{\\max}]$ "
"抽取删除数。给定删除数 $n$ 时，共有"
msgstr ""
"In `Fixed` mode, every output removes $n_{\\max}$ atoms. In `Variable` "
"mode, each output draws its removal count from the closed integer "
"interval $[1,n_{\\max}]$. For a given removal count $n$, there are"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:25
#: daaacbb55b614ea9add90e624b023ba1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Omega_n=\\binom{N}{n}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:29
#: e13822e3dddc4fc0957aa021f1867eb7
msgid "种不同的位点组合。结果按删除位点集合去重，并受“每个输入最大输出数”限制，因此实际输出数可能低于请求值。程序始终保留至少一个原子。"
msgstr ""
"distinct site combinations. Results are deduplicated by their sets of "
"removed sites and limited by `Maximum outputs per input`, so the actual "
"output count may be lower than requested. The program always retains at "
"least one atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:31
#: 15b73a966a944e9281d44ec2a5069d98
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:33
#: af3376d6b7e0406e9e162d1b1094a6cf
msgid "一个 100 原子的超胞需要生成最多 50 个、每个含 5 个空位的构型："
msgstr ""
"Suppose a 100-atom supercell should produce at most 50 configurations, "
"each containing five vacancies:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:35
#: f932622bc18c4150a765aca94a920929
msgid "“数量依据”选择“比例”，填写 `0.05`。"
msgstr "For `Quantity basis`, select `Fraction` and enter `0.05`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:36
#: 263b1d5f28ea4e248031130e6c65928a
msgid "“每个输出的空位数”选择“固定”。"
msgstr "For `Vacancies per output`, select `Fixed`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:37
#: d7693d6ea04648e19704d2ee4c9eda33
msgid "“每个输入最大输出数”填写 `50`。"
msgstr "Set `Maximum outputs per input` to `50`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:38
#: 2ac77293e76e44ecb177b2b0239cd7ca
msgid "位点采样保持“均匀随机”。"
msgstr "Leave `Site sampling` set to `Uniform random`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:40
#: 04c990113c8a4d529cba31f3c108a248
msgid "首帧预览会显示“删除 5 个原子”和唯一输出上限。若选择“变化”，每个输出会删除 1–5 个原子。"
msgstr ""
"The first-frame preview shows `Remove 5 atoms` and the upper bound on "
"unique outputs. If `Variable` is selected, each output removes 1–5 atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:42
#: d8f8b380a8b14953a8c52c1658d37bf1
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:44
#: 1b258c23904542e297e82317d8e01984
msgid "空位数量（num_condition）"
msgstr "Vacancy count (`num_condition`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:46
#: 9eaae1b846d04848bfe9e8aedd8069c3
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。数量依据为“数量”时使用；至少为 1，并且必须小于输入原子数。在“变化”模式下，它表示最大删除数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Used when the quantity basis is `Count`; it must be "
"at least 1 and smaller than the input atom count. In `Variable` mode, it "
"is the maximum removal count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:48
#: 3edc7a8aa5474c8a82a9d7257f6579fb
msgid "空位比例（concentration_condition）"
msgstr "Vacancy Fraction (concentration_condition)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:50
#: e55453acd95a46299c1aa0bb3f07db28
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.01`，范围 `(0,1)`。数量依据为“比例”时使用。程序计算 `floor(N × fraction)`；结果为 "
"0 时会提示当前输入至少需要的比例。在“变化”模式下，换算结果是最大删除数。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.01`, in the range `(0,1)`. Used when the quantity "
"basis is `Fraction`. The program computes `floor(N × fraction)`; if the "
"result is zero, it reports the minimum fraction required for the current "
"input. In `Variable` mode, the converted value is the maximum removal "
"count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:52
#: bdf70afb23cb4e82a343e7a20b68678a
msgid "数量依据（use_num）"
msgstr "Quantity Basis (use_num)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:54
#: f2400545e7b540deb2c3a01bb3880e09
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。界面中的“数量 / 比例”选择：`true` 使用绝对数量，`false` "
"使用整体比例。界面只显示当前生效的输入框。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. This corresponds to the `Count / Fraction` choice"
" in the interface: `true` uses an absolute count and `false` uses an "
"overall fraction. The interface displays only the currently active input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:56
#: c3095f048f3149d1833b40a444c41456
msgid "每个输出的空位数（count_mode）"
msgstr "Vacancies per output (`count_mode`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:58
#: b7f0dad3aa0c494da448b80f0a288db8
msgid "`str`，默认 `fixed`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `fixed`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 6db806302be544bebb0ef6401f982dd3
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: b8d54df81b384c57b496585a1073ec34
msgid "每个输出删除数"
msgstr "Atoms Removed per Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: c61455aadb1e4201b9e37a5fc01f38af
msgid "`fixed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 5dfb3d59975847b4bbd062f2d1f5b0b4
msgid "固定为解析出的数量"
msgstr "Fixed at the resolved count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: b1f54b6928b34c0693d3d4397bb1b58b
msgid "`random`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: c34a14e3f7a54b21959b69f1051cd9e1
msgid "从 1 到解析值之间随机抽取"
msgstr "Randomly drawn from 1 through the resolved value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:65
#: 2398d300ac9746cd9b39fe4fd0bafebf
msgid "每个输入最大输出数（max_structures）"
msgstr "Maximum outputs per input (`max_structures`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:67
#: 0fca02960b3844e0a6431c4a8ce94a71
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`，至少为 1。限制每个输入保留的唯一空位构型数；可用组合不足或随机抽样重复时，实际输出更少。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`, with a minimum of 1. Limits the number of unique "
"vacancy configurations retained for each input. The actual count is "
"smaller when too few combinations exist or random sampling produces "
"duplicates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:69
#: 61d48074fc27489f95572ae9662bea89
msgid "位点采样（engine_type）"
msgstr "Site Sampling (engine_type)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:71
#: e0770262b8c94194bb6689cf3327994f
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 7150ef00378b41458499dc1e70e2464b
msgid "值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: e68f9efde72a48af92c4e419b494c260
msgid "方法"
msgstr "Method"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 723de21dc6b94012b17450729d289162
msgid "适用情况"
msgstr "Suitable For"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 42f372a349c043aba26a273e0df87667
msgid "`1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 7d23efec2fc2446aa7416257a20a69e7
msgid "Uniform"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: f718e72d0aa845e2a25719d8c12e4f88
msgid "通用默认，伪随机均匀采样"
msgstr "General default; uniform pseudorandom sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 89f0e554af704bb18de8dc2955b8739f
msgid "`0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 06badb1c4b4e48b39e5dfa6e028904ca
msgid "Sobol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 050334848a5b487b9c6429190d8ec340
msgid "准随机覆盖；输入最多 21,200 个原子"
msgstr "Quasirandom coverage; inputs are limited to 21,200 atoms"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:78
#: 0b9a731e9bd440a2802ec50184ceb922
msgid "两种方法只改变位点组合的抽样顺序，不改变候选范围。"
msgstr ""
"The two methods change only the order in which site combinations are "
"sampled, not the candidate set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:80
#: d7e87271e38d42bb8e13a3e54f118a0d
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:82
#: 2ee54709ff664fc38c70904788b6c9b9
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后显示种子输入，并使相同输入与参数可复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enabling it reveals the seed input and makes "
"identical inputs and parameters reproducible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:84
#: 38b9775cb26f4245ab960cef94784a4b
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:86
#: bb5f23b5aae04529ae4b620b912161a1
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时使用。种子会结合结构内容派生，因此数据集中的不同输入帧不会机械删除相同原子序号。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`, used only when `use_seed=true`. The seed is combined "
"with the structure content, so different input frames in a dataset do not"
" mechanically remove atoms with the same indices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:88
#: e4150602ee2142f48b06e7c35d984353
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:90
#: 6b317baaff1041429b2a6f653337d2e8
msgid "`扩胞 → 全局空位`：先扩大晶胞，再生成空位。"
msgstr "`Super Cell → Global Vacancy`: enlarge the cell first, then generate vacancies."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:91
#: e65566e53c9a4d3bbc93ceabd771048e
#
msgid "`全局空位 → FPS 代表性采样`：从大量空位落点中筛选代表性构型。"
msgstr "`Global Vacancy → FPS Sampling`: select representative configurations from a large collection of vacancy placements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:92
#: bdb200f1ab8344ad81f4003618bfb989
#
msgid "只删除特定元素或原子层时，使用 `定向空位`。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Targeted Vacancy` when removing only a particular element or atomic "
"layer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:94
#: b644094ca84b4e22bdea6da26401780a
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:96
#: f3afce4a7faa434b8c23b88d87a906cb
msgid "**为什么比例 0.01 没有删除原子？** 对 $N$ 个原子的结构，至少需要 $f\\ge 1/N$，否则向下取整为 0。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a fraction of 0.01 remove no atoms?** For a structure with $N$"
" atoms, at least $f\\ge 1/N$ is required; otherwise rounding down gives "
"zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:98
#: 798c7136c63c42d599c85b9ee71dff32
msgid "**为什么多元素结构的组分会变化？** 所有位点都参与抽样，某种元素被删除的概率与它在输入中的位点数有关。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the composition of a multielement structure change?** Every "
"site participates in sampling, so the probability of removing a given "
"element is proportional to its number of sites in the input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:100
#: 4f46571bffe94168b710f93735e62443
msgid "**为什么实际输出少于设置值？** 删除位点相同的结果会去重，小结构的唯一组合数也可能不足。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are there fewer outputs than requested?** Results with the same "
"removed sites are deduplicated, and a small structure may not have enough"
" unique combinations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:102
#: 924b7a9041994900aedfc36e0297b8a2
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

